Create a polished character illustration of Patchouli Knowledge (パチュリー・ノーレッジ / 帕秋莉·诺蕾姬) from Touhou Project. A recognizable, faithful fan-art interpretation of her classic design, not a redesigned original character.

Identity: very long straight lavender-purple hair with neat bangs, purple eyes, a pale complexion, a quiet thoughtful expression. Wear her soft pale pink-lavender frilled mob cap with a small golden crescent-moon ornament and contrasting red/pink and blue ribbons. Matching ribbon ties adorn the long hair beside her face. Her modest ankle-length layered lavender robe has loose sleeves, gentle ruffles and subtle darker purple vertical stripes on the inner dress. No pointed witch hat, no horns, no bat wings, no tail.

Pose and framing: a single full-body character in a relaxed three-quarter standing pose, looking slightly toward the viewer while holding one open antique grimoire comfortably with both hands around waist height. Natural hands and coherent book geometry. Keep the cap, hair ends, dress hem and shoes fully within the canvas with generous breathing room. The character occupies approximately 80 percent of the image height. No panels, no alternate views.

Art direction: semi-painterly Japanese fantasy illustration. Delicate intentional linework around the face and silhouette, broad matte painted color masses in the clothing, restrained brushwork, two or three coherent value groups. Carefully chosen sharp edges near the eyes and book, softer edges in the lower folds and hair ends. Soft diffuse light from the upper left, restrained ivory highlights, rich but muted lavender and plum shadows. Expressive eyes without a glassy doll appearance; avoid plastic skin, glossy 3D rendering, over-smoothed airbrush gradients and uniform microscopic detail.

Background: a simple warm ivory paper-colored field with a very faint soft grounding shadow beneath her feet. Keep the focus on the character; no library set, elaborate magic circles, floating props or ornamental border. This is an opaque illustration, not a transparency request. No text, logo, signature or watermark. Portrait 2:3 composition.
